    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/plumbing-technician/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Plumbing Technician is a professional and highly functional theme designed specifically for plumbers, plumbing businesses, and plumbing contractors. Perfect for emergency plumbers, 24-hour plumbers, residential plumbing, commercial plumbing, and industrial plumbing services, it showcases plumbing repair, pipe repair, leak detection, drain cleaning, plumbing installation, water heater repair, plumbing maintenance, pipe fitting, faucet repair, sewer line repair, plumbing inspection, troubleshooting, and fixture installation. Ideal for licensed and certified plumbers, plumbing companies, and service providers, the theme helps highlight expertise, attract clients, and present services in a clear, organized manner. Its modern and clean layout features customizable sections for plumbing services, emergency contact information, client testimonials, and service galleries. Integrated with WooCommerce, the theme also allows selling plumbing products, tools, and maintenance packages online. With SEO-friendly, responsive design, easy navigation, and clear calls-to-action, Plumbing Technician ensures visitors quickly find services like drain cleaning, pipe repair, leak detection, and water filtration, establishing credibility and a strong online presence."
    },
